      129   DEFINE BUTTON b-cond-keep
      130        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      131        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      132        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      133        LABEL "Btn 1"
