      135   DEFINE BUTTON B-deliv-type
      136        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      137        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      138        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      139        LABEL "Btn 1"
